Vulnerability Discussion
Slide shows that are displayed on the lock screen could display sensitive information to unauthorized personnel. Turning off this feature will limit access to the information to a logged on user.

<#
.SYNOPSIS
    Sets the maximum size of the Windows Application event log to 32768 KB (32 MB) or greater, so events are not
    overwritten before they can be collected and reviewed. Windows 11 twin of the course sample WN10-AU-000500.

